<title>UK: DSL unit sets 500 mln mark 7-year bond.</title>
<headline>DSL unit sets 500 mln mark 7-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager WestLB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DSL FINANCE NV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  DSL BANK DEUTSCHE SIEDLUNGS-UND LANDESRENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.25	MATURITY    15.APR.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.58    PAY DATE    15.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.25	REOFFER    99.63     SPREAD	+5 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100</p>
<p> SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE/NETH</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.30	SELL CONC  1.95	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
